    <guid isPermaLink="false">6908968648dbe0eb56362941</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 03 Nov 2025 11:57:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我是四季，</span></p><span></span><p><span>一年不见，我是迷失了生活的节奏还是又寻找世界的宝藏去啦？</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌍 Show Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌍 第一部分：这一年我都去了哪里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a> 挪威：我决定继续寻找最美烟火</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a> 上海F1：我妈妈那一代人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="762">12:42</a> 清迈：曾经的咖啡店还在，人走散了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="928">15:28</a> 熊野古道：我比自己想象的要厉害很多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">19:08</a> 回国：阳朔超出预期的好玩</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌍 第二部分：这一年我又从生活中悟到了哪些东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1542">25:42</a> 孙燕姿演唱会还是被我追到了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1829">30:29</a> 我喜欢的女性们都给自己创造了更大的世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2232">37:12</a> 我经历过的经济上行期的美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2556">42:36</a> 朋友间最大的考验是价值观的不对等</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2685">44:45</a> 处理青少年的困惑我确实不懂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3080">51:20</a> 被自由放养长大的小孩也有她的求而不得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3774">01:02:54</a> 和E人同事相处中学到了哪些</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌍 第三部分：这一年我有哪些痛苦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4150">01:09:10</a> 还在文字表达和语言表达的两个系统中困惑着</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4653">01:17:33</a> AI时代害怕被落下和意识到的女性困境</span></p>]]></description>
