  <item>
    <title>EP16 当一个女性决定创业开餐厅，那些已知的困难和未知的性骚扰</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f43966696bd9a87969a2b6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f43966696bd9a87969a2b6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 16 Mar 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我是四季，</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期请来在北京创业开餐厅的管姐，一起来聊聊当一个女性决定创业开餐厅，那些汹涌而来的恶意和伤害，依然无法扑灭一个女性的梦想和善良。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们也试着深入聊聊当下女性创业者直面的性骚扰。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌍 Show Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">09:03</a> 管姐对自己曾经创业开餐厅失败经历的快问快答</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 四年后重启聊天，当初开餐厅是冲动之举吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 与口头邀约合作的朋友开启了管姐全新而又深刻的创业体验，其中有 “钱” “时间” “经营理念” 以及 “情绪价值”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1623">27:03</a> 创业的投资预期、回报预期以及现实回报</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1921">32:01</a> 作为单身独居女性餐厅创业者，被外卖小哥长期跟踪与性骚扰以及变态式恐吓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a> 女性创业者的另一种困境，来自同行男性竞争者的性骚扰及恶意投诉、造黄谣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 长期性骚扰后女性面临的失眠、噩梦及酗酒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 一波未平一波又起的酒局使得管姐的创业发生了“质变”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3525">58:45</a> 创业者的坚韧，扛起采购的大旗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3661">01:01:01</a> 稍有回暖的经营状态后突发全国抗疫，资金链的紧张直接决定了闭店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4030">01:07:10</a> 女性创业者仍然保持着对人和事的善意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4200">01:10:00</a> 当女性们谈“原谅”及北京工作过程中遇到的职场朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4680">01:18:00</a> 当管姐丢掉创业者的身份，又重回职场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5040">01:24:00</a> 当我们在年少时意识到了“我有一个梦想”</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkiYyBo_7Q1wHKx7z9hF0y_TTbzy.m4a" length="65342700" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:30:13</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZydE5pREtKWjRjR3BvZ0FLUTlOSHc0alU2M3QucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
