  <item>
    <title>EP15 北京、上海、加拿大、澳洲体感下，关于“年轻人、选择、困境”的漫聊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e073a4da891a9cd9a70f80</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e073a4da891a9cd9a70f80</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Feb 2024 12:08:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我是四季，</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期请来生活在加拿大的Nancy，一起来聊聊我们曾经及现在作为“年轻人”的选择和困境。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们也试着探索各自是否还拥有和创造自由的深度和广度。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌍 Show Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">02:40</a> Nancy做播客的契机和她正在进行的“和100位女性聊天”的播客记录。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">04:45</a> 你还记得曾经红极一时的club house吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> 四季在club house 比特币群中遇到光良，看到明星的另一面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a> Nancy在文字里认真观察生活，记录生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="564">09:24</a> 表达欲是很珍贵的东西，你的还在吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 当Nancy被问道“你还年轻吗”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="967">16:07</a> Nancy和四季各自分享自己是否还年轻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1210">20:10</a> Nancy分享在国内外一线城市上海、多伦多的工作经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> 四季分享国内一线城市生活时过度依赖信用卡和过度学习理财</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">37:30</a> 社交媒体隐藏着可怕的一面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a> Nancy聊她在多伦多是否还有奋斗的空间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> Nancy现在的Gap状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2980">49:40</a> Nancy和四季聊各自当下的困境和对困境的理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3560">59:20</a> Nancy和四季聊各自的新年展望</span></p>]]></description>
