  <item>
    <title>EP14 从伦敦电影学院毕业聊起，青年电影人请加油</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/655a9227b95673db2113b0d6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">655a9227b95673db2113b0d6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Nov 2023 22:54:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我是四季，</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期请来新晋青年电影人Willam，他刚刚从伦敦电影学院毕业，我们一起聊了下导演专业、海外成长以及若干电影相关的话题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌍 Show Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a> 电影圈常说的“拉片”是什么意思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a> 喜提伦敦电影学院offer遇疫情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> 电影行业岗位制的两年学习，导演专业究竟学什么和咋么学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 非科班的Willam入学短片拍了个啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> 电影风格和导演表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a> 十一国庆档张艺谋和张艺谋式的电影值得看吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> 跨语言跨文化的拍摄难度，Willam清晰的认知下要回国拍片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> 导演调教演员，演员影响导演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2710">45:10</a> 一边学习，一边聊钱，电影行业的众筹拍片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3330">55:30</a> Willam跨行学电影的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3560">59:20</a> 李鸿其新人首部电影得奖，现场观众并不买帐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4170">01:09:30</a> 导演也是一种表达，如何让发掘和坚持自己的表达欲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4350">01:12:30</a> 国内电影目前最流行的抖音、小红书2分钟片段真的很烦人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4680">01:18:00</a> 科班电影导演专业学习带来哪些成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4830">01:20:30</a> 导演别人也可以导演自己，人生可以有很大的弹性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5230">01:27:10</a> 学电影的初心和对未来的期待还保留着吗</span></p>]]></description>
