  <item>
    <title>EP10 从加拿大跨省搬家一直聊到自媒体“自驱力”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64de0c4080c9ec4c5f8b05b9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64de0c4080c9ec4c5f8b05b9</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 18 Aug 2023 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我是四季，</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期请来在加拿大八年生活的Ellen，我们一起聊了聊各自经历的跨省、跨洲搬家，和Ellen做YOUTUBE频道、四季做播客的各自成长。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在与Ellen的聊天过程中，我看到了她的目标清晰、坚毅且果敢，和她的自驱力。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌍 Show Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="365">06:05</a> Ellen刚刚结束的、加拿大一路向西的搬家之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a> 四季聊澳洲跨洲搬家的自驾和搭人经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1046">17:26</a> Ellen聊加拿大的搬家之旅以及她的人在乐途与人在囧途，与人、与风景的不同见闻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2530">42:10</a> 四季聊澳洲自驾旅程的体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2970">49:30</a> 四季和Ellen分享自驾经验，和各自如何保持清醒的窍门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> Ellen离开生活了8年的城市，原因竟然是////“天气”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3432">57:12</a> Ellen和四季聊彼此的“人生颠倒”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3592">59:52</a> Ellen一路从留学工作生活的8年加拿大旅程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3650">01:00:50</a> Ellen和四季聊两个国家的西厨学习和两部电影：《陪安东尼度过漫长岁月》《菜单》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3960">01:06:00</a> Ellen的留学路径高效且目标清晰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4560">01:16:00</a> Ellen开始做YOUTUBE频道《ellen: study cafe》，她的自驱力来自哪里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5040">01:24:00</a> Ellen坚持多年的马拉松给她带来了哪些影响</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkUn2VoOj1BZM8iD-FzHoOkzGBRH.m4a" length="72578326" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:31:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z1Y2dybjJpbnNnc2hlZFZ3Z283TTRycmRKaWEucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
